    "titleHighlight": "Questions",
    "subtitle": "Everything you need to know about SHAMS Free Zone. Still have questions? We're one message away.",
    "items": [
      { "q": "What is SHAMS Free Zone?", "a": "SHAMS (Sharjah Media City) Free Zone is a purpose-built free zone for media professionals and businesses — film, photography, advertising, design, music, and content creation. It offers low-cost setup, 100% foreign ownership, and quick licensing within 3-7 working days." },
      { "q": "Where is SHAMS Free Zone located?", "a": "SHAMS is located in Sharjah, UAE — one of the seven emirates. It provides excellent connectivity to Dubai and other emirates with easy access to major highways and airports." },
      { "q": "What is included in the SHAMS setup package?", "a": "Depending on the package, you get the Free Zone license, residency visa, medical & Emirates ID, lease agreement, bank account assistance, premium address, and free VAT consultation." },
      { "q": "How much does a SHAMS package cost?", "a": "Our SHAMS packages start from AED 5,999 (Economy) and go up to AED 16,999 (Mainland + Residency). Premium packages with visa start at AED 14,499." },
      { "q": "How long does setup take?", "a": "Typically 3-7 working days for license issuance, and additional 1-2 weeks for visa processing and bank account opening." },
      { "q": "Can I customize my package?", "a": "Yes. All packages are starting points and can be customized to match your media business, visa needs, and budget." },
      { "q": "Do I get a UAE residency visa?", "a": "Yes, select packages include a UAE investor/residency visa with medical, Emirates ID, and status change. The Free Zone License with Lifetime UAE Residency even offers lifetime residency." },
      { "q": "Is bank account opening included?", "a": "Yes. All packages include free assistance with corporate bank account opening at top UAE banks." },
      { "q": "What media activities can I do?", "a": "SHAMS supports film & video production, photography, advertising & PR, design, music & audio, content creation, and other media industries — with up to 5 activities in most economy packages." },
      { "q": "Why choose Setup Zone Dubai for SHAMS setup?", "a": "We offer transparent pricing, media industry expertise, dedicated consultants, and end-to-end support — from license to visa to bank account. All with 10,000+ successful setups." }
